  "note": "The Nest Warden has run her down on the open road — there is no getting away this time and nothing to fight it with but the cane. Declare the fight now, do not narrate it. them: the Nest Warden (18 health, 2-4 damage, dc 12, bonus 2) with ability name 'lunging bite', damage 10, advantage true, cooldown 3. athletics, their_dc 11, flee_dc 10.",
